    "description": "Automatic catchweigher designated the LI-700-D, operating as an automatic weight or weight/price labeller (Category Y) and as an automatic checkweigher (Category X); designated CWL-700-D when configured to operate only as an automatic checkweigher (Category X). Comprises a self-indicating and price-computing weighing machine with associated thermal label printer and mechanical handling facilities; packs are weighed dynamically at a constant rate of operation. Weighing system is a scale conveyor mounted on a load cell. Pricing, pack and labelling information is stored in PLUs. Devices: initial and semi-automatic zero-setting (max 4% of Max), automatic zero-setting after time interval (max 15 min), zero-tracking device, preset tare device, semi-automatic subtractive tare device, zero indication, price computation, PLUs, Ethernet and USB interfaces. Access to metrological settings secured by a switch on the A/D board enclosed in a metal case with tamper-evident seal; static calibration password protected with audit count number."
